## Recommended research workflows

### 1. Deterministic algorithm regression

Use deterministic RNG and fixed seeds when comparing code changes, compiler options, or backends:

```
OMP\_NUM\_THREADS=1 ./raptor --det-par --seed 42 --mode rdm --rdm-2d --out a.csv  
OMP\_NUM\_THREADS=4 ./raptor --det-par --seed 42 --mode rdm --rdm-2d --out b.csv
```

### 2. Detection-performance study

```
./raptor --det-par --seed 7 --mode rdm --rdm-2d --cfar-2d \\  
  --detector glrt --metrics-out metrics.json --detections-out detections.csv \\  
  --roc-out roc.csv --pd-pfa-out pdpfa.csv --truth-out truth.csv
```

### 3. MIMO/DOA/RAD product generation

```
./raptor --mode rad --rdm-2d --mimo-virtual-array --mimo-tx 2 --mimo-rx 8 \\  
  --doa music --angle-grid -70:70:1 --angle-out music.csv \\  
  --range-angle-out range\_angle.csv --rad-cube-out rad.csv
```

### 4. Contested-spectrum / EW analysis

```
./raptor --mode rdm --rdm-2d --jam 15 35 --jam-type drfm \\  
  --drfm-latency 75 --drfm-bits 8 --interferer --ep-mode adaptive-notch \\  
  --burnthrough-out burnthrough.csv --jamming-metrics-out ew.json
```

### 5. Target ingestion

```
